# Launchd labels that bin/sim-test disables on a simulator it boots itself.
# iOS 27.1 simulators crash these Siri, intelligence, Mail and Spotlight daemons on every boot (from the Degen report,
# 2026-11-12). Each crash is noise in DiagnosticReports.
# The disable lives in the device data, so it survives a reboot and not an erase.
# The widget and app-intent daemons are not listed: they stay on.
# One label per line. Blank lines and lines that start with # are skipped.
